# Claude artifact links in docs/handoff/HANDOFF.md (added 2026-08-22 by #362). These are PRIVATE
# artifacts from the originating session: claude.ai answers an unauthenticated fetch with 403, so a
# link checker can never verify them and is only measuring claude.ai's auth behaviour. They sat
# unnoticed because this workflow's `push` trigger had not re-run over that file since 2026-09-10,
# while the `pull_request` trigger has no path filter - so the first PR to reach it failed on a
# defect that had been on master for five weeks.
https://claude.ai/code/artifact/*
